      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T14:06:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should do that.\nChromium and Dawn\u0027s copies can get out of sync, so running in different checkouts can produce a different JSON.\nI\u0027d rather have this script fail when run from Chromium checkout.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 38,
        "startChar": 17,
